<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- Nkangala New Testament Zambia</book>
  <para style="h">2 Timateo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda ua mucivali ua Paulu kuli Timateo</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timateo</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Tim</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda ua Paulu ua mucivali kuli</para>
  <para style="mt1">TIMATEO</para>
  <para style="imt">Citsindikisi</para>
  <para style="ip">Livulu lia mucivali lia Timateo liapua mukanda uamucivali uakuhuma kuli kanganda Paulu kuli ndongisi uendi Timateo. Mukanda ua Timateo uamucivali vausonekele kuyehi nakuhua ca muono ua Paulu. Va muhakele mu kamenga mu Loma ha ntsimbu eyi (2 Tim 1:16). Paulu uakele na vusamba vuakukola na Timateo kaha vintsimbu viavingi uakele nakumutumbula nguendi muana (Fil 2:22, 1 Tim 1:2, 1:18).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ou ukeuo umo ua mikanda iuana yakuhuma kuli Paulu ije yasonekelelele kuli muntu keti ku cikungulukilo. Ikuavo itatu ku mikanda eyi ikeyo ya 1 Timateo, na Tito na Filimoni. Ha ntsimbu ije mukanda ua 2 Timateo vakele naku usoneka, vaka Yesu vakele nakuvapakesa mu nganda ya Loma. Eci cikeco canehele linga Paulu vamuhake mu kamenga kaha uakele nakushika Timateo linga atualeleleho nalukakateya mukukaluua. Ngue kuya mu 1 Timateo, Paulu ahana Timateo vinangulo viavingi ha valongisi vamakuli (1 Tim 1:16-18). Kaha naua alekesa Timateo nguendi kukakala vintsimbu via kukaluua kulutue (3: 1).</para>
  <para style="iot">Muvanavitumbikilamo:</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Paulu aputuka nakuhinduisa Timateo (1: 1-2) kaha ambahoni amukolese (1: 3-18).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Ambahoni alekesa Timateo linga atualeleleho nalukakateya (2: 1-13).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Cakuhatako amuhana vinangulo vimo vije muasa kuyoyelamo (2: 14-26).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Ambahoni amunangula ha vije vikalingiua kulutue na ngila yacili muje vati akasa kuvitambula (3: 1-4; 8).</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Paulu amanusula na mezi endi lika kuli Timateo (4: 9-24).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1"/>Yange Paulu, kanganda ua Kilistu Yesu ku cizango ca Njambi kuya ku cikulaheso ca muono uje uli muli Kilistu Yesu,<verse eid="2TI 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2"/>Njikusonekela yove Timateo, munange injazanga:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 1:2">Kavumbi, cikeketima na ciyulo vije vihuminina kuli Njambi Tate na Kilistu Yesu Muene yetu.<verse eid="2TI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kutsatsela na Kulikolesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3"/>Njitsantsela Njambi uje injikapangela na mana akutungukua, ngue muje muvalingile vakukuluila vange, omo njikamianuka vintsimbu vioshe mu malombelo ange. <verse eid="2TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4"/>Ngue muje njikanuka masozi eni, njikatondo cikuma vutsiki na mutania kumimona, linga njakushule nanzolela. <verse eid="2TI 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5"/>Njilinakuanuka lutsilielo luove lua vusunga, lutsilielo luje luakele hakulivanga muli kuku yove uampuevo Loisi na vanoko Yunisi nahano vene, cilivene nguange nove uli naluo. <verse eid="2TI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6"/>Ha cuma eci njikuanukisa linga uhozelele vuana vua Njambi vuje vuli muli yove kuhitila muje munjakusalekele mavoko ange. <verse eid="2TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7"/>Omuo Njambi katuhanene Cimbembesi ua liova vuno honi Cimbembesi ua nzili na cizango na kulihilula yetu vavenia.<verse eid="2TI 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8"/>Keti uvue shuamua ya kuhana vukaleho vua Muene yetu, cipue vuange cinzinda cendi, vuno honi lipangele nange mukuyandela muzimbu uacili mu nzili ya Njambi. <verse eid="2TI 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9"/>Ikeye uatuovuele nakutusana nakusana ca kulela, keti ngue kuya ku vipangi vietu vuno honi ku vutumbe vuendi na kavumbi vije viatuhanene muli Kilistu Yesu tele kanda mavu va atange, <verse eid="2TI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10"/>vuno honi vanacisolola kuhitila mukusoloka ca Muyoyesi uetu Kilistu Yesu, uje nanongesa kutsa nakuneha muono na kuhona kutsa ku ceke kuhitila mu muzimbu uacili. <verse eid="2TI 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11"/>Omuo ya muzimbu uacili ou, vanjihanguile kupua muka kuambulula na kanganda na mulongisi, <verse eid="2TI 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12"/>nankuma njilinakuyanda ngue muje munjili nakuyandelamo. Vuno honi kunjesi na shuamua, omuo njatantekeya uje njinatsiliela, kaha njatantekeya cilivene asa kuniunga muacili vije vinjinakundika kuli ikeye noho ha Litangua lije. <verse eid="2TI 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13"/>Kavangeya cimueso ca mezi a vusunga aje unevu kuli yange mu lutsilielo na cizango vije vili muli Kilistu Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14"/>Niunga muacili vusunga vuje vuvanakundika kuli yove na Cimbembesi Uakulela uje uakala muli yetu.<verse eid="2TI 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15"/>Uatantekeya nguove voshe vaje vali mu Asiya vananjitengulukila, kupandakana kumo na Fingeliase na Helemengenese. <verse eid="2TI 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16"/>Muene ahane cikeketima ku ntanga ya Onesifolase, omuo vintsimbu viavingi ikeye nakala nakunjilisa, kakele na shuama na malienge ange, <verse eid="2TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17"/>vuno honi omo uahetele mu Loma, uanjitondele cikuma nakunjiuana. <verse eid="2TI 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18"/>Muene amutavese linga auane cikeketima cije cikahumu kuli Muene ha Litangua lije! Uatantekeya muacili vipangi vije viakuasele mu Efeso.<verse eid="2TI 1:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2"/>
  <para style="s">Lisualale Uacili ua Kilistu Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1"/>Ambahoni yove munange, kolesa mu kavumbi kaje kali muli Kilistu Yesu, <verse eid="2TI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2"/>na vije viunevu kuli yange ha mesho a vakaleho vavengi vaje vakundama ku vantu valutsilielo vaje vasa kulongesa na vakuavo naua. <verse eid="2TI 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3"/>Lipangele mu tuyando ngue lisualale uacili ua Kilistu Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4"/>Naumo uahi lisualale asa kulinga nevi na vije mu vipangi viendi via vusualale, omuo viyongola viendi vinapu kutonda kuvuahelesa uje ntuama yendi. <verse eid="2TI 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5"/>Muka kushatuka kuvasa kumuzika cilongo kuvanga ashatuke muailamo mashiko. <verse eid="2TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6"/>Ndimi uakupanga cikuma ikeye napande kukala na mutambela uakulivanga ua vimbuto. <verse eid="2TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7"/>Singaniekaho hali evi njihandeka, omuo Muene akakuhana kuvuisisa muli vioshe.<verse eid="2TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8"/>Anuka Yesu Kilistu, vamusanguile ku vatsi, uapuile mutekuluila ua Ndaviti, ngue muvanaviambulula mu muzimbu uange uacili, <verse eid="2TI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9"/>muzimbu uacili uje unjilinakuyandela nakukala mu malenge ngue nji muhuza. Vuno honi lizi lia Njambi likelio kuliesi mu malenge. <verse eid="2TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10"/>Nankuma njilina kutualelelaho nalukakateya mu viuma vioshe ha mulonga ua vaje vavanahangula, linga navakevo vakauane kuovoka muli Kilistu Yesu na vumpau vuaco vua miaka yoshe. <verse eid="2TI 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11"/>Eci kuhandeka ca vusunga nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">“Nga tunatsi nendi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:11">kaha naua tukayoya nendi,<verse eid="2TI 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12"/>nga tutualelelaho na lukakateya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">kaha naua tukayula nendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">nga tumuviana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">nendi naua akatuviana.<verse eid="2TI 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13"/>Nga kutuesi nalutsilielo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">ikeye hanga uapua ualutsilielo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">omuo kasa kuliviana ikeye vavenia.”<verse eid="2TI 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muka Vipangi uje Ivanatambula kuli Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14"/>Vanukise evi, kaha vanangule ku mesho a Muene linga keti vakale na vimpata ha mezi, eci kucesi naseho, vuno honi cipihisa vaje vaka kuvuilila. <verse eid="2TI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15"/>Linga muuaselamo kulihana yove vavenia kuli Njambi ngue uje ivanatambula, ngue muka kupanga uje kasa kukala na shuama, uje akuata muacili lizi lia vusunga. <verse eid="2TI 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16"/>Litenge ku vimpata via kasauntu na vimpande via vupi vije vituala lika vantu kulahako na Njambi. <verse eid="2TI 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17"/>Kaha vimpande viavo vinapu ngue mbandu yamukongo. Vamo hhakati kavo vapuile Haimenease na Filetase, <verse eid="2TI 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18"/>vakevo vaje vanaseza vusunga omuo vahandeka nguavo kusanguka cinahiti laja. Valinakupihisa lutsilielo lua vakuavo. <verse eid="2TI 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19"/>Vuno honi luvula lua Njambi hanga luemana ngoo, na kasateso aka nguavo, “Muene atantekeya vaje vendi,” kaha naua nguavo, “Eceleni uoshe uje atumbula lizina lia Muene ahume ku viuma via mazilo.”<verse eid="2TI 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20"/>Mu njivo yakama kumuakele lika vitenga via ngolinde cipue via siliva vuno honi na via kupanga ha miti na via vuma, vimo via ha cipale navikuavo viakupangesa lika hali hoshe. <verse eid="2TI 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21"/>Nga umo alilelesa ikeye vavenia ku vitenga viakupangesa hali hoshe, kaha akapua citenga cakupangesa ha cipale, viakulela na seho kuli liavenia njivo, vialivuahesela lumo kuvipangesa ku vipangi viacili. <verse eid="2TI 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22"/>Teua ku mashungu a vukuenje kaha pangela lika vusunga, na lutsilielo, na cizango, na ciyulo hamo na vaje vasana Muene na mitima yakulela. <verse eid="2TI 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23"/>Litenge ku vimpata via vulema na vunzimba, uatantekeya nguove vikanehe kulicokota. <verse eid="2TI 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24"/>Ngamba ya Muene kapandele kupua muka kulicokota vuno honi napande kupua ua ngozi ku muntu uoshe, mulongisi uacili, ualukakateya, <verse eid="2TI 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25"/>uje asa kuhilula vaje vamuluisa na mutima uakulikehesa. Linga hamo Njambi akavahanako ntsimbu linga vakatenguluke ku vipi kaha vakatantekeye vusunga, <verse eid="2TI 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26"/>linga vateue ku muheto ua Liyavolo, uje navakuata linga vapange muaya cizango cendi.<verse eid="2TI 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3"/>
  <para style="s">Kuyoya cakuhona Njambi mu Matangua a Mamanusuilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1"/>Vuno honi ivuisisa eci, mu matangua akumanusuilo kukakala vintsimbu viakukaluua. <verse eid="2TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2"/>Omuo vantu vakapua vaka kulizanga vakevo vavenia, vakazanga vimbongo, vakalihalesa, vaka lijundula, vakapua vaka kasauntu, vakahona kuononoka visemi viavo, vaka hona kutsatsela, vaka hona kulela, <verse eid="2TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3"/>vaka keniuka, vaka hona cikeketima, vakapua vakaleho va makuli, vakapua vaka cipululu, vaka hona kulihilula, vakazinda viacili, <verse eid="2TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4"/>vaka luuangania, vaka lupozoka, vaka shula nakulihalesa, vaka zanga senga kupulakana kuzanga Njambi, <verse eid="2TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5"/>vaka kakateya viuma via cifua cakulemesa Njambi vuno honi vakaviana nzili yavio. Litengeni ku vantu ava. <verse eid="2TI 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6"/>Omuo vamo vavo vakalingi vingila viavo viakukovela mu vinjivo via vantu nakukuata vampuevo vaje vakuzeya, vaje vali na viteli via vipi kaha vanashulu na miyati yoshe ya viuma via mazilo, <verse eid="2TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7"/>vaje vakevuilila kuli muntu uoshe vuno honi kuvasa kuheta hatsimbu ya kutantekeya mana a vusunga. <verse eid="2TI 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8"/>Ngue Njane na Njambele valuisile Mosesa, mukemo vene na vantu ava valuisa vusunga, vantu va mana a civembulu kaha vaka kuhonoua mu lutsilielo. <verse eid="2TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9"/>Vuno honi kuvasa kuya kulutue, omuo vulema vuavo vukasholoka ku vantu voshe, ngue vua vaje vamala vavali.<verse eid="2TI 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vishika via Kumanusuila kuli Timateo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10"/>Honi yeni munakavangeya vilongesa viange, nakatumamesi kange, na vutumbe vua vuyoye vuange, na lutsilielo luange, na kusimpa cange, na cizango cange, na lukakateya luange, <verse eid="2TI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11"/>na mapakeso ange, na tuyando tuange, na viuma vije vialingiuile kuli yange ku Antioke, naku Ikoniyame naku Lisitala, mapakeso akukomouesa aje anjatambuile, vuno honi Muene uanjohielele kuli vakevo voshe. <verse eid="2TI 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12"/>Cilivene uoshe uje atonda kuyoya vuyoye vua vunjambi muli Kilistu Yesu vaka vapakesa, <verse eid="2TI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13"/>oku vantu vaka vupi na vaka mantseno vakatualelelaho kulinga vupi cikuma, kukuisa vakuavo na vakuavo naua vakavakuisa. <verse eid="2TI 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14"/>Vuno honi yove tualelelaho kuli vije unalilongesa kaha kolesa mukutsiliela omuo uatantekeya uje kuualilongeselelevio, <verse eid="2TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15"/>kuhuma ku vuanike vuove uatantekeya vilongesa via kulela vije viasa kukutuamenena ku kuovoka kuhitila mu lutsilielo muli Kilistu Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16"/>Visoneka vioshe Njambi uavihuiminine kaha vili naseho mukulongesa, na mukushulisisa, na mukuhilula, na mukuhana vilongesa mu vusunga, <verse eid="2TI 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17"/>linga muntu ua Njambi apue uamutuntu, nakushula mu vipangi vioshe viacili.<verse eid="2TI 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4"/>
  <para style="s">Kusompa cili nakuija honi Lingeni muacili Vipangi vieni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1"/>Njikushika ha mesho a Njambi na Kilistu Yesu vaje vakasompo vaka kuyoya na vaka kutsa, kaha mukusholoka cendi na vumuene vuendi, <verse eid="2TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2"/>ambulula lizi, livuahesele vualumo mu vintsimbu viacili cipue via vipi, sungamesa, tenukila, takamesa, longesa na lukakateya, keti uhonoue mukuvandamena namukulongesa. <verse eid="2TI 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3"/>Omuo ntsimbu ilinakuija omo vantu kuvakahakela mana kuvilongesa via vusunga vuno honi hakukala na matuitui akujua, vakalitondela vakevo vavenia valongisi linga vakalinge vije vivatonda. <verse eid="2TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4"/>Kaha vakalikela kuvuilila ku vusunga nakuputuka kuvuilila visimo via makuli. <verse eid="2TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5"/>Vuno honi yove ntsimbu yoshe livuahesele vualumo, kolesa mu tuyando, linga vipangi viakuambulula muzimbu uacili, shulisisa mu vipangi viove.<verse eid="2TI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6"/>Omuo yange njalivuahesela vualumo kunjilinga nkombelo, ntsimbu yange yakukatuka inahete. <verse eid="2TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7"/>Njinalu nzita yacili, njinashatuka nakumanusula seteko yange, njinaniungu lutsilielo. <verse eid="2TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8"/>Honi kuli cilongo ca vusunga civananjitulikila, cije Muene ikeye muka kusompa ua vusunga akanjihanaco ha Litangua lije, kaha keti yange lika vuno honi na vaje voshe vazangele kusholoka cendi.<verse eid="2TI 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mezi Ange</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9"/>Linga muoshe muuasela linga uije kuli yange vuavuno. <verse eid="2TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10"/>Omuo Ndemase nazange mavu aua aliko, nanjiseze nakuya ku Tesalonika, na Kelesenese nayi ku Ngalatiya, na Tito nayi ku Ndalematiya. <verse eid="2TI 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11"/>Kuvanga lika Luka likaliendi ikeye ali nange. Ambata Mako linga uije nendi, omuo ikeye ali naseho mukunjipangela. <verse eid="2TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12"/>Njatumu Taikikase ku Efeso. <verse eid="2TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13"/>Omo uija, ija na kazaku kaje kajasezele kuli Kapasi ku Tolouase, na mavulu, kaha cikuma kuma mikanda yange ije yakuzenga ya vilambu. <verse eid="2TI 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14"/>Elekizanda uje muka kufula nanjilingi muamupi cikuma, Muene akamuhana fueto kuya ku vipangi viendi. <verse eid="2TI 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15"/>Litenge kuli ikeye, omuo ualuisile muzimbu uetu na nzili. <verse eid="2TI 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16"/>Ha kuliluila cange cakulivanga, naumo uahi uanjikuasele, voshe vanjisezele. Keti vavahisileco! <verse eid="2TI 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17"/>Vuno honi Muene uakele nange nakunjikolesa mukuambulula muzimbu mukushula, linga na vaje voshe keti Vayunda vauvue. Kaha uanjovuele naku kanua ka ndumba. <verse eid="2TI 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18"/>Muene akanjohiela ku via vipi vioshe nakunjohiela ku vumuene vuendi vua muilu. Kuli ikeye kukale vumpau ku miaka yoshe ya yaye. Ameni.<verse eid="2TI 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vihindu Viakumanusuila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19"/>Cihindu kuli Pulisila na Akuila nakuli vaka ntanga ya Onesifolase. <verse eid="2TI 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20"/>Elasitase uasalele ku Kolinte, kaha njasezele Tolofimase ku Miletase oku avavala. <verse eid="2TI 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21"/>Linga muoshe muuasela linga uije ntsimbu kanda cisika cihete. Eumbulase natumu vihindu kuli yove hamo na Pundenisi na Linase na Kalaundiya na vaka kutsiliela voshe vanatumu vihindu. <verse eid="2TI 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22"/>Muene akale na cimbembesi cove. Kavumbi kakale nove.<verse eid="2TI 4:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4"/>
</usx>
